WEBVTT

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.690
Another peaceful day in the Hidden Leaf—

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.200
Or maybe not.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.560
Guy Sensei, what's wrong?!

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:44.210
Ouch...

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.000
What is wrong with you?

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.470
G-G-G-G-Guy Sensei!

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.480
<b>Might Guy - A Story of Love and Hair</b>

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:17.660
That's supposed to be my normal 
shampoo, but my hair...

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.320
This?

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:20.530
Byakugan!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.480
This is Orochimaru's doing.

00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:26.700
So slapdash.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.790
It's okay. Who cares about 
a few missing strands?

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.840
That's right, cheer up, Guy Sensei!

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.080
You...

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:36.700
You don't care?

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:38.510
Of course not!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:41.340
You're the Leaf's Noble Blue Beast!

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.230
No one's going to care!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.280
Guy Sensei!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:12.200
Oh, hi... Here for training?

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.910
Nope! We're just bringing you a present.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.050
For you!

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.840
You guys...

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.490
Something feels off.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:24.850
He needs something aggressive.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.650
No class.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:29.390
What about...

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:32.650
I know.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:35.390
That actually works!

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:37.150
Nothing creepy about it!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.160
Guy Sensei has been reborn!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.110
Thank you, you three...

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.810
But it's pointless.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.270
No blood flows through a wig...

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.590
I can't feel any youthful 
energy like this.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:57.780
It's just a wig.
Is it really that big a deal?

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:00.360
Well, they don't make wigs 
with blood vessels...

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.750
I know! We have to find 
a wig that's alive!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:04.780
Huh?

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.360
For example...

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.930
This will grow.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.500
Growth is the problem?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.350
Or...

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:13.360
The silhouette will match perfectly.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.730
Yeah, but not him!

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.660
It's no good.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.900
If I can't feel the love...

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.440
they won't make good partners.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.310
Forgive me...

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.790
I'm... finished...

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:33.830
Blood flow...

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.650
Love...

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:36.850
Eureka!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.850
What is it this time?

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.900
He needs a pet wig!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.340
What does that even mean?

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.830
A living creature that you treat 
with love. That's a pet!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.670
If he makes the wig into a pet,

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.770
then Guy Sensei's sure to feel the love!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.270
A pet, of course!

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.090
Let's get moving!

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:54.770
Where?

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.260
Please, Ino!

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:58.260
Oh no.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.560
Mind-Body Switch into this wig!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:02.990
What are you thinking?!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:05.160
If she controls the wig with 
her Mind-Body Switch Jutsu,

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.750
it can become a real pet!

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.020
No, it can't!

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.000
I think it will really help Guy Sensei!

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:12.330
Forget about it.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:15.910
Please!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.330
Please!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:20.590
Please.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:23.710
Please!

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.270
Please!

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.760
Please!

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.240
Fine...

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.390
Guy Sensei, good morning!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:36.700
Allow to introduce you 
to the ultimate partner!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:38.730
Lee?

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.970
I'm sorry, could you leave me—

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:42.730
Here you are, Guy Sensei.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.540
Take a look.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:48.860
What is...

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.080
Behold, the ultimate tailed beast!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:06:00.610
100,000 Tails

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.660
His name is Cuticle!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.950
He's got a hundred thousand 
tails. Can you believe that?!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.870
Thousands upon thousands more tails...

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.670
...than Gaara's One-Tail 
or Naruto's Nine-Tails!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.480
Everyone one of those 
little hairs is a tail!

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.670
Lee, did you...

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.470
Okay.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.030
I'm not sure what's going on,

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.890
but I'm very grateful 
for the burning concern...

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.530
...you have for your teacher.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:13.390
Sir!

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:21.150
Come forth, Cuticle!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.130
This is the hundred thousand-tails?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.350
It's a little...

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:41.070
<i>This is no good.</i>

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.130
<i>I need to really make 
him feel the love.</i>

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.390
Greetings, my most exalted master!

00:06:48.390 --> 00:06:49.870
I am Cuticle!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.050
You can talk?!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.980
Exalted master, I give 
you my word that I'll...

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.110
...work hard to make you 
love and accept me!

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:59.520
I don't think effort can 
overcome that barrier.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:00.900
Work hard?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.320
Very well, starting today...

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.850
...you are my partner!

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:14.550
Wig is youth!

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.040
Wig is youth!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:18.480
Wig is youth!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:20.410
Wig is youth!

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.540
He did it...

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.500
Let's go, Cuticle!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.170
Yes, my master!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:30.340
Death Strike, Cuticle Frenzy!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.520
Reload!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:34.290
Sir!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.880
Death Strike, Cuticle Frenzy, again!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.900
I don't even get how that move works...

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.820
Here I go, my master!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:49.020
All right, go!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.920
Youthful shampoo dance!

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.160
Splendid! What a hot-blooded 
soul you have!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.830
Cuticle, you're the 
greatest partner ever!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.720
What's its soul got 
to do with anything?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.620
Nothing, I imagine...

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.740
We gotta watch this.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:12.300
Master, I would prefer 
to watch this one.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:15.230
This one.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.210
This is better!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.220
Mine!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.100
Mine!

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.270
They're arguing.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.890
Why are we watching?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.030
Cuticle!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:19.840
Master!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.000
Cuticle!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.500
Master!

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:31.380
I'm sorry, we'll watch 
whatever DVD you want!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.890
Oh, master!

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:35.650
This is so cliché...

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.470
Why is he doing a rom-com 
scene with a wig?

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.940
And so it went.

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.060
I'm getting heartburn...

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.250
I can't...

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.270
Take it anymore...

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.570
Bathing with Guy Sensei...

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.240
Sleeping with Guy Sensei...

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:01.380
No more! No more! I'll die!

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.940
Sorry, Ino...

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:04.570
Sorry ain't cutting it!

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:07.240
I'll never recover from this...

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.740
Ino's at her limits.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.540
Hey, look.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:17.390
Guy Sensei's hair's coming back!

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.090
Time for the final stage.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.680
Leave? But why?!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.650
Thank you for everything.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:29.100
But I must return to the 
Tailed Beast Village now.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.770
Cuticle!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:34.440
This was always going to be temporary.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:39.740
Please don't. I thought 
we'd be together forever!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.810
Master.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.600
Your true partner is...

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.420
...up there.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.300
Cuticle!

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.320
Master!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:07.770
Live happily with your real hair!

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:13.560
Thank you.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.480
I'll never forget you.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.290
Seriously... No more...

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.570
No!

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.480
What's wrong, Lord Orochimaru?!

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:31.440
I accidentally used my poison shampoo!

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.060
How can I crush the Leaf 
Village looking like this?!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.000
It's all right, Lord Orochimaru.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.190
I, Kabuto, predicted this might happen,

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.900
and prepared a contingency.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:44.690
Come forth, hundred thousand-tails!

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.050
Oh, I like it.

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:54.980
It looks much better than it should.

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:06.220
Today our three heroes are 
polishing their teamwork,

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.500
using new training—

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:11.080
Training, new—

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.500
Hey, are you all right up there?

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:18.230
Sorry. My throat's bugging me...

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.960
Well, that's no good!

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:23.510
I haven't had one day off...

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.310
It's catching up to me.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:28.300
You want some time off?

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:29.080
Huh?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:39.480
<b>Substitute Narrator</b>

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:43.030
You're sure you can 
handle narrating, Lee?

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.410
I really think I'd be better—

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.770
Don't sweat it.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:50.230
I'll just work hard like 
always and do a bang-up job!

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:52.170
That's what I'm afraid of.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.790
Okay, here goes!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:56.550
This is the Hidden Leaf Village.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:59.950
As usual, we can find three particular
shinobi training their tails off.

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.960
There's only two of us here.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.800
But our hearts remain as one.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.000
Let's start by introducing them.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.230
That far back?

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:07.930
Tenten!

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.520
A very kind young woman,

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:13.810
but a scary one, who can summon a
plethora of weapons in an instant.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.140
Her punchlines are sharp.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.780
Lady Tsunade is her heroine,

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:19.120
but she has many inches to go 
to catch up to her, bust-wise.

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:21.240
She's the only character on the 
show with a Chinese design,

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:23.560
but the only thing that's really 
Chinese about her is her name.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:25.220
Yesterday, she gained a ton of weight...

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:27.390
...when she ate an entire 
bowl of Ichiraku Ramen's—

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:28.690
Enough already!

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:29.640
Neji.

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:31.990
He likes cross-dressing.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:35.600
That's it?

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.380
I don't do it for fun!

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:40.550
Two everyday ninjas,
who went to a normal school,

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.720
and became normal ninjas.

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.030
But what makes them and 
Team Three unique...

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:49.470
...is their third member, a cool, 
strong man who everyone loves.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.440
That genius of hard work, Rock Lee!

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.930
Why do you get the good parts?!

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.300
I'm really getting the hang of this.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:58.800
I'm not sure you are...

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:02.030
Okay, Lee, I'll leave it to you.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:05.480
No problem. Have a relaxing 
vacation, Mr. Narrator!

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:07.330
S-Sure...

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.750
Training, the light that filled your world.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.780
Training, the hope that filled my heart.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:22.360
The training that unites us.
That pure, blue training.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.890
What training are you talking about?!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.860
Their first task is...

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.250
Push-ups.

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:33.660
Tenten dropped down and started.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:36.580
Bending her arms, pushing 
her muscles to the limit.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.790
Neji dropped down and started.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.520
He put his feet together,

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:44.030
kept his back straight, 
and pushed off the ground.

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.340
Their goal was ten thousand reps!

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:49.910
That's impossible!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:55.360
Next, they must to climb a waterfall, 
starting right in the middle.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.620
Let us hope they get 
through unscathed...

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.590
Neji!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.960
Let's skip to Tenten.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.300
Skip me altogether!

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:12.020
Next on the schedule 
is shuriken practice.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.810
Thank the lord, something normal.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:15.860
However...

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:16.940
However?

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.910
I've really got a craving for pudding.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:22.250
Let's do some pudding-cooking 
training instead.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.780
Are you serious?

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.320
A young girl with a broken heart,

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.910
meditating as she is 
blanketed with snow.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.250
A lone seagull cries out.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.450
Neji's Byakugan prevents 
his eyes from drying out.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.390
Byakugan!

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.980
The pair switch to harsh 
spiritual training.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.250
This is insane!

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.290
The pair find themselves looking at...

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.500
The latest "Make-Out Dance!"

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.250
What sultry secrets lie inside?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:51.070
Whoa, that's far enough!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.180
Only the highest-caliber of ninja 
can resist such temptation!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:58.310
The bell rings, and their trial begins!

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.610
<i>Oh yeah, I'll just use my Byakugan...</i>

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.820
<i>Just a little further...</i>

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:17.410
Neji!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.520
What is the point of all this?!

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:22.620
Kakashi Sensei's the only one who 
reads this Make-Out stuff anyways!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.290
You rang?

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:24.650
Huh?

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:25.970
Oh, hey.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.420
Hey, guys, what's up—

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.900
We slipped away when he 
wasn't looking. Don't—

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:37.310
Naruto Uzumaki.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:39.010
Always running around.

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:41.330
Just another Leaf Ninja.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.520
Lady Tsunade oughtta whack him one,

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.960
as long as it doesn't 
make him transform.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:47.790
What was that?

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.780
You're about to find out.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:51.870
Oh, there you are Naruto!

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.510
Sakura Haruno!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.970
If the village is a goddess, 
here is its angel,

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.930
its radiant beacon of hope!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:02.760
Her forehead shines 
brighter than the stars!

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:04.510
Wider than the biggest ocean,

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:05.960
standing tall and proud like Mt. Fuji,

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.090
blazing forth like the morning sun!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.750
I am but a gaseous nebula of love,

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:13.430
being sucked into the black 
holes that are her eyes!

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:15.370
Why is Lee narrating?

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:16.760
It's a long story.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:20.030
Let's find someone else for him to
introduce, so we can do something else.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.640
If we get him started on Guy Sensei, 
he'll forget all about us!

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:27.090
Ah, we've forgotten one of 
the most important players!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.620
Indeed, indeed!

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.650
You've gotta tell everyone about him!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.650
Understood. Him, eh?

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:37.650
Meanwhile...

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.070
Huh? H-Hey, you're early.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:42.270
I'm... Where are my lines...

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.010
Only one thing comes to mind...

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:46.590
...when you see that authority 
of antagonism, Orochimaru!

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:47.990
One thing?

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:49.400
Have at it

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:53.420
Um, err, uh...

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.670
Swallow 'em whole!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.900
And then?

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.180
And then...

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.550
Spit 'em out!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.650
Apparently his trademark 
eye lines are just makeup!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.700
Looks like his real 
eyes are very small.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:21.570
It's weird. I've been dying 
for a vacation, but...

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.520
I wonder what's going 
on back at the village.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:28.670
Maybe...

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.430
Maybe they're fine without me.

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.030
Mr. Narrator!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.640
Mr. Narrator!

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:45.100
Who, me?

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.050
What're you doing here?

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:50.430
You have to come back to 
the village right away!

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:51.240
Huh?

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.120
Seriously, right now!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.760
Okay, he's been introduced.

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.630
What about him?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:57.590
Him?

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.990
Yeah, you know, him!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.530
Oh, him!

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.220
Kakashi Hatake, there he is!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.520
It seems like the show's doing fine.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.620
Fine my foot!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:11.630
Um...

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:15.250
Oh, Lee, that other person 
wants you to introduce him!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.250
There is a man who can cleave 
fate in two with his fist!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.260
A man who would stand against 
the heavens themselves!

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.210
That man is—

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:23.260
Guy Sensei?

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.820
I can't even read in peace...

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:26.890
All done!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.890
Everyone and their mother's begging 
for you to introduce them!

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:31.940
Traitor to the village, Uchiha Sasuke.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.490
He's doesn't really fit in,

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.110
which is why he doesn't 
appear on the show.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.190
Not him!

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:42.080
This is the problem! 
He's gonna keep bringing...

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.260
...up things we're not supposed to mention!

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.810
Please come back, Mr. Narrator!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:55.940
All right.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:58.720
Let's do it!

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:04.630
That's about everyone 
who's anyone around here.

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:07.090
Now it's time for everyone to train!

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:08.820
I don't think so.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:15.190
Take him down, Mr. Narrator.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.810
Leaving behind the gentle 
sound of crashing waves,

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:23.320
a lone narrator returns 
from a beach resort.

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:28.630
His long battle is about 
to come to an end.

00:20:28.630 --> 00:20:30.740
His final opponent,
none other than Rock Lee!

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:32.970
Disciple of Guy Sensei,

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:35.420
known as "The Leaf's 
Beautiful Blue Beast."

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.630
But his true nature is 
simply a training-aholic.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:40.870
Desperately in love with Sakura,

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:44.640
yet his lack of game 
stymies his efforts.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:48.380
He owes Tenten 3,180 ryou.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:52.830
And he makes Neji cross-dress 
because he thinks it looks cute!

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:13.080
That vacation was just what I 
needed to get my voice back.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.340
I'm so glad you're back!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:18.320
Make sure you take better care 
of yourself from now on!

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:21.000
You're the only narrator we've got!

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:24.420
Y-You guys...

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.030
I was starting to worry if the 
show even needed me at all.

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:31.180
But to think all of you 
appreciate me so much...

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:34.960
Don't worry, I'll be sure 
to return the favor,

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.350
and narrate all your 
embarrassing secrets, too!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:44.320
The narrator knows all!

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:24.360
Next week is "Save Ichiraku Ramen!"

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:26.420
<b>Save Ichiraku Ramen!
Vacations are for Training!</b>

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:26.420
and "Vacations are for Training!"

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:29.680
I've never gone a single 
day without training.

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:36.190
Huh? Didn't you say you spent our 
last day off watching movies?

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:39.240
How dare you?! Those movies 
were part of my training, too!

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:41.840
Movies are treasure troves of 
useful genjutsu techniques.

00:23:41.840 --> 00:23:43.750
They're not genjutsu, they're skits!

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:47.300
All these references are turning 
you from a ninja into a comedian!
